!! Study notes

Create a tiddler in the local notebook, tag it ''Study Note'', and link it to an example with TiddlyWiki links such as `[[g_buffer/gbuffer_5/frag.glsl]]`. Notes stay unpublished until their file and title are explicitly approved in `notebook/public-content.json`. Never commit sensitive notes to a public repository.

<ul>
